 "remarks": "Life your best life in this beautifully renovated waterfront home! Located in a first-class community with beautiful grounds, inground pool and garage + guest parking, this is a first-floor garden apartment overlooking the marina and boardwalk. Enjoy the open new kitchen with designer sea glass cabs, window-lined living room leading to the pretty patio, fabulous new bath, high ceilings, laminate floors, personal washer + dryer and parking. The Stamford Landing community is meticulously maintained, featuring an outdoor pool and spa. One small pet per owner discretion. Please submit through Rentspree.",
